  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197380",
      "title": "Splitting Components Into Smaller Components",
      "lectureOrder": 27,
      "videoOrder": 24,
      "sourceHash": "8e63d7e8b98b46d7e593be6b33c5a37a47bbdeec067004c89d44904e1e5c443d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.86,
          "end": 3.693,
          "en": "So by now, we already learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.693,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "a lot about important React Native components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "and concepts in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "Our app JS file is getting bigger and bigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 14.35,
          "en": "And this is something that happens in most React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.35,
          "end": 16.54,
          "en": "no matter if you're building for React Native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.54,
          "end": 18.343,
          "en": "or if you're building for the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.328,
          "end": 21.97,
          "en": "Your components get bigger as you add more functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.97,
          "end": 25.96,
          "en": "Now, what do in such cases is you break up your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.96,
          "end": 29.01,
          "en": "and you split them into smaller components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.01,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "That is a common approach and a common best practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "for keeping your code maintainable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 37.12,
          "en": "And it's no difference here for React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.12,
          "end": 40.33,
          "en": "Thus far we're working with one component only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.33,
          "end": 43.08,
          "en": "but this of course is the exception.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.08,
          "end": 46.51,
          "en": "The norm is that you do work with multiple components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.51,
          "end": 48.403,
          "en": "And we wanna do that here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.48,
          "end": 51.96,
          "en": "For this, I'll add a new folder in my project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 53.4,
          "en": "which I'll name \"components\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 56.01,
          "en": "because I wanna store my components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.01,
          "end": 57.7,
          "en": "You don't have to use this name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.7,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "but it is a common convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 63.088,
          "en": "since we will be building and storing components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.088,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "And then I want to add two components files in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 68.48,
          "en": "Goal input JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.48,
          "end": 70.19,
          "en": "because there I plan to store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.19,
          "end": 75.19,
          "en": "the data input related JSX code and functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.46000000000001,
          "end": 78.32,
          "en": "And goal item JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.32,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "here I plan to store the actual JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 84.7,
          "en": "and functionality that is related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.7,
          "end": 87.513,
          "en": "without putting single goal items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.85,
          "end": 91.21000000000001,
          "en": "And of course you could split this into more components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.21000000000001,
          "end": 92.95,
          "en": "if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.95,
          "end": 96.044,
          "en": "Now I'll start working on this goal item component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.044,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "In there I'll add a function goal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.688,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "because I'll create a functional component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 103.753,
          "en": "and I will export this as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.6,
          "end": 107.263,
          "en": "So I will build a standard React component in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.36,
          "end": 111.61,
          "en": "Now you don't need to import React from React here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.61,
          "end": 114.09,
          "en": "You did need to do that in the past",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 117.14,
          "en": "but with the modern versions of React Native and React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.14,
          "end": 118.85,
          "en": "you don't need to do that anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.85,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "and therefore a functional component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 122.773,
          "en": "can be created just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.528,
          "end": 125.48,
          "en": "Now in this goal item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.48,
          "end": 127.64,
          "en": "I wanna return some JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.64,
          "end": 129.47,
          "en": "and I actually wanna return the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.47,
          "end": 132.47,
          "en": "that is responsible for outputting a single goal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.47,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "So not the list of items, but a single item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.43,
          "end": 138.7,
          "en": "And that means I wanna use this code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 138.7,
          "end": 141.524,
          "en": "Hence, I will cut this code from app JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.524,
          "end": 144.953,
          "en": "and return it here in goal item JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.27,
          "end": 149.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now, of course, here, I'm referring to some styles though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.82999999999998,
          "end": 154.23,
          "en": "and those styles therefore also should be brought over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.23,
          "end": 157.76,
          "en": "For this I have to create a new style sheet object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.76,
          "end": 160.224,
          "en": "that belongs to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.224,
          "end": 161.54,
          "en": "So to this component file also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.54,
          "end": 166.36,
          "en": "and hence I will import from React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.36,
          "end": 171.36,
          "en": "and I will import the style sheet object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.416,
          "end": 174.31,
          "en": "Which allows me to call the create method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.31,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "which creates a new React Native managed styling object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.39600000000002,
          "end": 181.69,
          "en": "which helps with auto completion and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.69,
          "end": 184.37,
          "en": "I'll store this in a constant named styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.37,
          "end": 186.712,
          "en": "though the name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.712,
          "end": 189.596,
          "en": "but since I'm already referring to this kind of constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.596,
          "end": 190.47899999999998,
          "en": "here in my code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.47899999999998,
          "end": 192.05,
          "en": "I will keep the name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.05,
          "end": 195.9,
          "en": "Now as a side note, we could have also passed our styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "from app component to goal item component via props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 202.44,
          "en": "We don't have to define the styles here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.44,
          "end": 205.34,
          "en": "but it is a good practice to keep your styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.34,
          "end": 207.19,
          "en": "close to your JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.19,
          "end": 209.01,
          "en": "And therefore I wanna move my styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.01,
          "end": 210.57,
          "en": "that belong to the goal item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.57,
          "end": 214.81,
          "en": "from the app component into the goal item component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.81,
          "end": 217.37,
          "en": "And that would be these two objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.37,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "with their style properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.84,
          "end": 223.69,
          "en": "I will cut them in app JS and move them over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.69,
          "end": 225.93,
          "en": "to goal item JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.93,
          "end": 229.45,
          "en": "And here in this object which we pass to the create method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.45,
          "end": 232.24,
          "en": "I'll paste in these two properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.24,
          "end": 234.79,
          "en": "And with that, I can reference those properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.79,
          "end": 236.303,
          "en": "in my JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.10399999999998,
          "end": 239.61,
          "en": "So with that, we are creating this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.61,
          "end": 242.2,
          "en": "We still need to take care about this text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.2,
          "end": 244.36,
          "en": "but we get our first component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.36,
          "end": 248.49,
          "en": "and then app JS we can now import this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.49,
          "end": 250.44,
          "en": "We can now also get rid of some imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 250.44,
          "end": 252.92,
          "en": "which we don't need anymore because I'm, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.92,
          "end": 255.47,
          "en": "not displaying a text component in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 255.47,
          "end": 257.45,
          "en": "and I'm not using scroll view anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 258.998,
          "end": 263.998,
          "en": "But I will now import goal item from components goal item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 270.536,
          "en": "And this works just as it works in our regular React app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.536,
          "end": 273.44,
          "en": "we import our components from other files like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.44,
          "end": 275.2,
          "en": "we have a capital starting character",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 275.2,
          "end": 277.97,
          "en": "because we plan on using this in JSX",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.97,
          "end": 279.52,
          "en": "and we wanna make it clear to React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.52,
          "end": 281.06,
          "en": "that this is a custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 281.06,
          "end": 283.673,
          "en": "Hence we start with a capital character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 284.73,
          "end": 287.61,
          "en": "Now down here in our JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 287.61,
          "end": 292.61,
          "en": "where I return some markup inside of render item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 292.8,
          "end": 297.33,
          "en": "I now return my goal item component, so my own component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.33,
          "end": 301.05,
          "en": "And this is how we define and use a custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 303.56,
          "en": "And of course in the end it's totally the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 303.56,
          "end": 308.039,
          "en": "as we do it in a React for web project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.039,
          "end": 309.989,
          "en": "There isn't really any difference here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
